sequenceDiagram
    participant W as SyncWorker (Ch 30)
    participant TS as SyncTokenStore
    participant Srv as Backend
    participant Room as Room (SSOT)

    W->>TS: lastToken
    loop pages until hasMore=false
        W->>Srv: GET changes-since(token)
        Srv-->>W: changes + tombstones + nextToken + hasMore
        W->>Room: upsert changes (version-aware, Ch 33)
        W->>Room: delete tombstoned ids
        W->>TS: save nextToken (resumable)
    end
    Note over W: failure mid-way -> resume from saved token next run
